<title>JAPAN: Nittetsu Steel Pipe - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nittetsu Steel Pipe - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 12.11		vs	   12.69</p>
<p> Operating   loss 494 million	 vs   loss 186 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 495 million	 vs   loss 211 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 670 million	 vs   loss 320 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 15.24 yen	  vs     loss 7.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     44 million	  vs	  44 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nittetsu Steel Pipe Co Ltd is a manufacturer of small-diameter steel tubes.</p>
